===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*dewk-}}
Borrowed from {{bor|en|la|ductus||leading, conducting|pos=noun}}, from {{af|la|dūcō|-tus|t1=to lead, conduct, draw|pos2=action noun suffix|nocat=1}}. {{doublet|en|ductus|douit}}. Also via {{bor|en|ML.|ductus||a conveyance of water; a channel}}, which itself has the first mentioned etymology.

